{"product_id":"foxy-vape-3000-puffs","title":"Foxy Vape (3000 puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe FOXY DISPOSABLE VAPE device is draw activated and pre-filled with 8ml of 40mg E-liquid. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe foxy disposable vape brings an easy vape for portability and ease of use. Foxy disposable p\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eod Device c\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eomes with a fully charged battery that is guaranteed not to lose charge until e-liquid is fully enjoyed. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFoxy vape is a longer-lasting disposable vape and a great way to enjoy salt nic vaping.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFoxy disposable vape offers a button-less design and is activated when inhaled. It completely wipes out the task of charging, refilling, and maintaining your mods. It comes in different flavors to make sure that users do not have to leave their comfort zone or sacrifice the tastes they are accustomed to and after every puff, the exotic flavors leave you with a driven head change that enhances your smoking experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecification\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: FOXYVAPE\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiquid Capacity : 8.0ML Built-in Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine by volume: 4.0%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-style: italic;\"\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e3000 PUFFS\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1100mAh \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Foxy","offers":[{"title":"Watermelon Bubble","offer_id":41611961991223,"sku":"Foxy V (3k P) - Watermelon Bubble","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Luch Ice","offer_id":41611962023991,"sku":"Foxy V (3K P) - Lush Ice","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Lolipop","offer_id":41611962056759,"sku":"Foxy V (3K P) - Lolipop","price":999.0,"cu